To develop a C++ program that simulates basic digital logic gates and displays their outputs for given binary inputs.

#Features
Simulates basic digital logic gates.
Accepts binary inputs (0 and 1).
Displays the corresponding gate outputs.
Helps understand digital electronics concepts.
Provides a simple, menu-driven interface.

#Algorithm
Start the program.
Display the available logic gates.
Ask the user to select a gate.
Accept the required binary inputs.
Perform the selected gate operation.
Display the output.
Stop the program.
